<p class="cl-lead">Reading about cured in place pipe only goes so far. This short animation shows the whole idea in under a minute: a bad pipe, a liner going in, a cure, a new pipe. Underneath it is a scene-by-scene walkthrough with the detail the animation leaves out, so you know what you are looking at and what the same step looks like on a real job.</p>

